      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This would also be a big help to people like myself who do avatars for the roleplaying and pvp communities around vrc. I myself am a warhammer model maker, and the stuff i make i put on the description do not reuse nor steal from: (server name)\nAnd even with this warning on there people take it knowing they shouldnt. So iv offered account uploads but as the person above stated this makes people uneasy apart from those that started the community with me and know i mean no harm im trying to stop their avi getting leaked. Please look into this, the communities around vrc not even just the WH40k one would love you for it.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
