      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Would be nice to have options to allow only people to use an avatar based on various requirements:\nOnly Friends\nOnly Whitelisted\nOnly Members (when guilds/groups finally makes its way into VRC)\nOnly in presence of creator/owner (only in same instance)\nSimilarly would be nice to be able to \"clone/transfer\" a avatar to a specific account, with the receiving end getting a message: \n\"YourFriendlyCreator is sending you Wolfboi57 do you accept?\"",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
