      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I feel like a way to implement this is with levels.\n\nYou can add friends to certain \"levels\" and order them in a list. Then you can set your whitelist level to certain rings of friends. These levels can also probably work in a better way with groups, where you can filter friends by levels. It can probably use the existing group data structure on the backend.\n\nIt can also possibly be nice to have an opt-in \"always\" level that is at the top, where someone can join you no matter what.\n\nAt the very least, being able to toggle a whitelist for the 3 existing friend groups would be nice.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
